11:51.880 --> 11:53.040
The priority must always

11:53.040 --> 11:54.300
be preserving a manifold

11:54.300 --> 11:55.020
of good,

11:55.180 --> 11:56.260
survivable futures.

11:56.540 --> 11:57.080
what they call

11:57.080 --> 11:57.820
admissibility.

11:58.080 --> 11:58.300
Right.

11:58.500 --> 11:59.220
Because the act

11:59.220 --> 12:00.300
of hyperoptimization

12:00.300 --> 12:01.920
