12:03.300 --> 12:04.180
to heat the house.

12:04.620 --> 12:06.160
You destroy secondary systems

12:06.160 --> 12:07.840
and future flexibilities

12:07.840 --> 12:09.180
to hit a single metric.

12:09.440 --> 12:10.240
So history,

12:10.480 --> 12:10.880
distinction,

12:11.160 --> 12:11.640
reachability,

12:11.820 --> 12:12.180
repair,

12:12.420 --> 12:13.220
and admissibility.

12:13.660 --> 12:14.820
The author isn't just

12:14.820 --> 12:16.040
presenting these as a neat

12:16.040 --> 12:17.120
philosophy for project

12:17.120 --> 12:17.560
management.

12:17.660 --> 12:18.060
Not at all.

12:18.220 --> 12:18.840
They are claiming

12:18.840 --> 12:19.940
these five commitments

12:19.940 --> 12:21.140
are the organizational

12:21.140 --> 12:22.300
invariance of the

12:22.300 --> 12:23.160
physical universe,

12:23.320 --> 12:24.920
which requires us to ask,

12:25.480 --> 12:26.140
if the universe

12:26.140 --> 12:27.420
is not made of static

12:27.420 --> 12:28.700
nouns and objects,

12:29.320 --> 12:30.540
how do we explain

12:30.540 --> 12:31.360
cosmology?

12:31.640 --> 12:31.860
Yeah,

12:31.940 --> 12:32.540
how do we explain

12:32.540 --> 12:33.520
the literal fabric

12:33.520 --> 12:34.120
of space?

12:34.240 --> 12:34.660
Exactly.

12:34.900 --> 12:35.400
This is where

12:35.400 --> 12:36.440
the Flyxion program

12:36.440 --> 12:37.740
introduces its physical

12:37.740 --> 12:38.240
substrate.

12:38.480 --> 12:40.040
They call it the RSVP.

12:40.220 --> 12:41.100
The relativistic

12:41.100 --> 12:42.260
scalar vector plenum.

12:42.380 --> 12:43.060
It is a total

12:43.060 --> 12:44.140
reconceptualization

12:44.140 --> 12:45.320
of fundamental physics.

12:45.860 --> 12:46.840
Standard cosmology

12:46.840 --> 12:47.840
treats the vacuum

12:47.840 --> 12:48.340
of space

12:48.340 --> 12:49.060
as a passive

12:49.060 --> 12:50.020
background stage.

12:50.020 --> 12:51.120
It's an empty theater

12:51.120 --> 12:52.140
where the actors,

12:52.340 --> 12:52.680
quarks,

12:53.100 --> 12:53.580
electrons,

12:53.740 --> 12:54.140
photons,

12:54.580 --> 12:55.340
they just bounce

12:55.340 --> 12:56.220
around and interact.

12:56.600 --> 12:57.860
RSVP rejects

12:57.860 --> 12:58.600
the empty theater.

12:59.020 --> 12:59.740
It argues that

12:59.740 --> 13:00.700
the plenum itself

13:00.700 --> 13:01.640
is the fundamental

13:01.640 --> 13:02.600
reality composed

13:02.600 --> 13:03.880
of three dynamically

13:03.880 --> 13:04.920
coupled fields.

13:05.980 --> 13:06.580
Let's explore

13:06.580 --> 13:07.200
these fields

13:07.200 --> 13:07.820
because the way

13:07.820 --> 13:08.360
they interact

13:08.360 --> 13:09.420
is just wild.

13:09.620 --> 13:10.240
It really is.

13:10.340 --> 13:11.200
The first is

13:11.200 --> 13:11.720
phi,

13:12.020 --> 13:13.120
the capacity field.

13:13.220 --> 13:13.360
Yeah,

13:13.420 --> 13:14.180
phi measures

13:14.180 --> 13:15.440
the local degree

13:15.440 --> 13:16.960
of structural coherence

13:16.960 --> 13:18.460
or organizational potential

13:18.460 --> 13:19.700
at any given point

13:19.700 --> 13:20.280
