13:31.300 --> 13:32.500
incredibly complex

13:32.500 --> 13:33.380
layered structures.

13:33.640 --> 13:34.260
Like stars

13:34.260 --> 13:34.920
or chemistry

13:34.920 --> 13:35.620
or biology.

13:35.700 --> 13:36.100
Exactly.

13:36.440 --> 13:37.180
If phi drops

