13:46.780 --> 13:47.640
So phi is the raw

13:47.640 --> 13:48.660
potential for complexity.

13:49.160 --> 13:49.640
Then we have

13:49.640 --> 13:50.340
the second field,

13:50.560 --> 13:50.900
little v,

13:51.120 --> 13:52.000
the transport field.

13:52.500 --> 13:53.080
This dictates

13:53.080 --> 13:54.020
how that organizational

13:54.020 --> 13:54.940
potential flows

13:54.940 --> 13:55.600
from one region

13:55.600 --> 13:56.100
to another.

13:56.340 --> 13:56.840
But we need

13:56.840 --> 13:57.720
to be careful here

13:57.720 --> 13:59.120
because it's easy

13:59.120 --> 13:59.820
to picture this

13:59.820 --> 14:01.680
