14:03.160 --> 14:03.360
Right.

14:03.460 --> 14:04.100
It's not physical

14:04.100 --> 14:04.860
stuff moving.

14:05.200 --> 14:05.880
It is fundamentally

14:05.880 --> 14:06.540
different from

14:06.540 --> 14:07.200
a traditional

14:07.200 --> 14:08.320
velocity field

14:08.320 --> 14:09.080
moving matter.

14:09.880 --> 14:10.500
Little ave

14:10.500 --> 14:11.900
encodes the propagation

14:11.900 --> 14:13.600
of structural coherence

14:13.600 --> 14:14.060
itself.

14:14.480 --> 14:15.560
It is not moving

14:15.560 --> 14:16.040
a thing.

14:16.360 --> 14:17.100
It is moving

14:17.100 --> 14:17.920
the capacity

14:17.920 --> 14:18.860
for organization

14:18.860 --> 14:19.940
from regions

14:19.940 --> 14:20.500
