14:22.720 --> 14:23.740
demanded by the

14:23.740 --> 14:24.720
historical constraints

14:24.720 --> 14:25.320
of the system.

14:25.660 --> 14:26.180
And the concept

14:26.180 --> 14:26.740
of demand

14:26.740 --> 14:27.640
is what brings us

14:27.640 --> 14:28.960
to the third field,

14:29.100 --> 14:29.480
big S,

14:29.820 --> 14:30.880
the constraint field.

14:31.260 --> 14:31.920
This is the one

14:31.920 --> 14:32.560
that forces you

14:32.560 --> 14:33.200
to completely

14:33.200 --> 14:34.260
rewire your brain.

14:34.520 --> 14:35.000
It's a big one.

14:35.340 --> 14:36.240
The framework proposes

14:36.240 --> 14:36.880
that the universe

14:36.880 --> 14:38.220
has a fundamental field

14:38.220 --> 14:39.660
dedicated to obligations.

14:40.200 --> 14:40.840
The S field

14:40.840 --> 14:41.900
accumulates stress

14:41.900 --> 14:42.840
based on the history

14:42.840 --> 14:43.400
of interactions

14:43.400 --> 14:44.320
within the plenum.

14:44.600 --> 14:45.120
Every time

14:45.120 --> 14:46.020
a complex structure

14:46.020 --> 14:47.060
forms and interacts,

14:47.480 --> 14:48.620
it creates constraints.

14:49.020 --> 14:49.780
It alters

14:49.780 --> 14:50.940
the surrounding topology.

14:51.000 --> 14:51.560
So it remembers.

14:52.060 --> 14:52.400
Yes.

14:53.400 --> 14:54.140
The S field

14:54.140 --> 14:55.100
records the degree

14:55.100 --> 14:56.280
to which past

14:56.280 --> 14:57.560
organizational activity

14:57.560 --> 14:58.580
