14:58.580 --> 14:59.160
for future

14:59.160 --> 15:00.080
coherence maintenance.

15:01.120 --> 15:01.620
So,

15:01.760 --> 15:02.740
if a region of space

15:02.740 --> 15:03.640
has a high value

15:03.640 --> 15:04.200
