15:14.340 --> 15:15.100
It is the first

15:15.100 --> 15:16.680
core commitment history

15:16.680 --> 15:17.420
before state,

15:17.840 --> 15:18.500
literally written

15:18.500 --> 15:19.360
into the mathematics

15:19.360 --> 15:20.320
of space-time.

15:21.180 --> 15:22.040
The universe carries

15:22.040 --> 15:23.200
the accumulated debt

15:23.200 --> 15:24.320
of its own history.

15:24.580 --> 15:25.480
And these three fields,

15:25.620 --> 15:26.100
capacity,

15:26.440 --> 15:26.840
transport,

15:26.940 --> 15:27.520
