15:30.440 --> 15:31.000
and evolution

15:31.000 --> 15:31.540
of the universe.

15:31.640 --> 15:32.200
They really do.

15:32.400 --> 15:33.460
The briefing outlines

15:33.460 --> 15:34.080
a model called

15:34.080 --> 15:35.680
Falling Universe Cosmology.

15:35.960 --> 15:37.380
Which explicitly rejects

15:37.380 --> 15:38.600
the standard inflationary

15:38.600 --> 15:39.440
model of the Big Bang.

15:39.640 --> 15:40.740
In standard cosmology,

15:40.740 --> 15:41.540
we are taught

15:41.540 --> 15:42.680
the balloon analogy.

15:43.100 --> 15:43.780
The universe started

15:43.780 --> 15:44.520
