15:44.700 --> 15:45.920
infinitely dense point,

15:46.220 --> 15:47.340
and then space itself

15:47.340 --> 15:48.800
rapidly expanded outward

15:48.800 --> 15:49.540
like the rubber

15:49.540 --> 15:50.280
of a balloon

15:50.280 --> 15:51.080
being inflated.

15:51.400 --> 15:52.360
And the galaxies

15:52.360 --> 15:53.160
are just dots

15:53.160 --> 15:54.000
drawn on the balloon

15:54.000 --> 15:54.520
