15:54.520 --> 15:55.040
from each other.

15:55.220 --> 15:55.680
Right.

15:56.120 --> 15:57.480
RSVP cosmology

15:57.480 --> 15:58.680
looks at the same

15:58.680 --> 15:59.860
observational data,

16:00.360 --> 16:01.160
the smoothness

16:01.160 --> 16:02.180
