16:02.180 --> 16:02.740
background,

16:03.000 --> 16:04.080
the apparent expansion

16:04.080 --> 16:04.820
of space,

16:04.980 --> 16:05.780
and provides

16:05.780 --> 16:07.780
a radically different mechanism.

16:08.080 --> 16:08.780
A completely

16:08.780 --> 16:09.460
different mechanism.

16:09.560 --> 16:10.480
The observable universe

16:10.480 --> 16:11.340
