16:56.620 --> 16:57.540
That rolling transfer

16:57.540 --> 16:57.980
of tension

16:57.980 --> 16:59.400
is the perfect visualization

16:59.400 --> 17:00.720
of what the author calls

17:00.720 --> 17:02.200
lamphrodyne relaxation.

17:02.820 --> 17:03.800
Lamphrodyne relaxation.

