Exactly.

17:21.260 --> 17:22.120
Channels that allowed

17:22.120 --> 17:23.620
this massive constraint debt

17:23.620 --> 17:24.440
to slowly,

17:24.720 --> 17:26.100
evenly resolve itself

17:26.100 --> 17:28.140
across extended timescales.

