19:02.760 --> 19:04.020
That question transitions us

19:04.020 --> 19:05.200
from fundamental physics

19:05.200 --> 19:07.040
to the ontological layer

19:07.040 --> 19:07.700
of the framework,

19:08.180 --> 19:09.840
distinguishability geometry.

19:10.260 --> 19:11.360
Distinguishability geometry.

19:11.780 --> 19:12.960
This branch of the theory

19:12.960 --> 19:14.340
explores how the configuration

19:14.340 --> 19:15.600
space of reality

19:15.600 --> 19:16.900
actually acquires

19:16.900 --> 19:18.280
comprehensible structure.

19:18.860 --> 19:19.700
How do observers

19:19.700 --> 19:20.680
