19:28.120 --> 19:29.820
It is an active partition.

19:30.720 --> 19:31.320
Distinguishability.

19:32.100 --> 19:33.280
Geometry mathematically

19:33.280 --> 19:34.440
defined the distinction

19:34.440 --> 19:35.860
as a partition

19:35.860 --> 19:37.660
that requires an observer

19:37.660 --> 19:39.080
