19:39.080 --> 19:40.240
of measurement apparatus

19:40.240 --> 19:42.060
to actively maintain.

19:42.260 --> 19:42.540
Okay.

19:42.760 --> 19:43.880
And running that apparatus

19:43.880 --> 19:44.900
costs his resources.

19:45.380 --> 19:46.780
It costs biological energy

19:46.780 --> 19:48.120
or computational cycles

19:48.120 --> 19:49.580
or institutional funding.

19:49.740 --> 19:49.960
Right.

19:50.060 --> 19:51.080
The ATP example

19:51.080 --> 19:51.660
from earlier.

19:51.840 --> 19:52.220
Exactly.

19:52.560 --> 19:53.220
If the observer

19:53.220 --> 19:54.060
