21:24.240 --> 21:24.980
of the game

21:24.980 --> 21:26.700
because your measurement apparatus,

21:27.020 --> 21:27.460
the TV,

21:27.680 --> 21:28.880
literally lacks

21:28.880 --> 21:30.060
the structural capacity

21:30.060 --> 21:32.040
