that temporarily degraded

22:08.440 --> 22:09.600
without altering

22:09.600 --> 22:10.620
the overall worldview

22:10.620 --> 22:11.260
of the system.

22:11.360 --> 22:11.860
Okay, so in the

22:11.860 --> 22:13.020
television analogy...

22:13.020 --> 22:13.840
In your television

22:13.840 --> 22:14.380
analogy,

22:14.880 --> 22:15.600
this is realizing

22:15.600 --> 22:16.700
the contrast knob

22:16.700 --> 22:17.240
got bumped,

22:17.520 --> 22:18.160
making everything

22:18.160 --> 22:19.060
look washed out.

22:19.240 --> 22:19.380
Yeah.

22:19.540 --> 22:20.380
You turn the knob,

22:20.820 --> 22:21.760
