22:21.940 --> 22:22.700
and you can see

22:22.700 --> 22:23.440
the shades of gray

22:23.440 --> 22:24.140
clearly again.

22:24.200 --> 22:25.320
Okay, so it's a quick fix.

22:25.520 --> 22:26.100
In a laboratory,

22:26.700 --> 22:27.860
it's recalibrating

22:27.860 --> 22:29.140
a drifting spectrometer.

22:29.660 --> 22:30.680
In a corporation,

22:31.120 --> 22:31.880
it's retraining

22:31.880 --> 22:32.460
an employee

22:32.460 --> 22:33.480
who forgot

22:33.480 --> 22:34.020
the standard

22:34.020 --> 22:34.940
operating procedure.

22:35.660 --> 22:36.600
The underlying

22:36.600 --> 22:37.880
framework of reality

22:37.880 --> 22:39.000
is not questioned.

22:39.500 --> 22:40.000
You are just

22:40.000 --> 22:41.120
performing routine

22:41.120 --> 22:41.560
maintenance

22:41.560 --> 22:42.240
on the existing

22:42.240 --> 22:42.720
boundaries.

22:42.720 --> 22:44.160
So it's a localized

22:44.160 --> 22:44.740
fix,

22:44.980 --> 22:45.660
but second-order

22:45.660 --> 22:46.540
repair requires

22:46.540 --> 22:47.800
a structural shift.

