22:57.260 --> 22:57.820
your distinction

22:57.820 --> 22:58.460
topology.

22:58.980 --> 22:59.780
You have to invent

22:59.780 --> 23:00.720
an entirely new

23:00.720 --> 23:01.220
category.

23:01.460 --> 23:02.040
So going back

23:02.040 --> 23:02.880
to the TV...

23:02.880 --> 23:03.360
Returning to your

23:03.360 --> 23:03.680
analogy,

