23:24.100 --> 23:24.760
of space-time.

23:25.000 --> 23:26.400
So if Second-Order

23:26.400 --> 23:27.100
is buying a

23:27.100 --> 23:28.020
completely new

23:28.020 --> 23:29.080
apparatus to invent

23:29.080 --> 23:29.980
new categories,

23:31.200 --> 23:32.160
what on Earth

23:32.160 --> 23:33.060
is Third-Order

23:33.060 --> 23:33.620
Repair?

23:33.900 --> 23:34.700
Are we realizing

23:34.700 --> 23:35.520
