23:37.060 --> 23:37.760
Third-Order Repair

23:37.760 --> 23:38.780
is the most profound

23:38.780 --> 23:39.240
and the most

23:39.240 --> 23:40.180
destabilizing.

23:40.700 --> 23:41.380
It does not just

23:41.380 --> 23:42.300
change the categories.

23:42.500 --> 23:43.260
It changes the

23:43.260 --> 23:44.660
metal-level criteria

23:44.660 --> 23:46.100
by which we evaluate

23:46.100 --> 23:47.060
what makes a category

23:47.060 --> 23:48.260
valid in the first place.

23:48.360 --> 23:48.880
That sounds

23:48.880 --> 23:49.820
incredibly deep.

23:49.980 --> 23:50.380
It is.

23:50.700 --> 23:51.180
The shift from

23:51.180 --> 23:51.940
