24:06.740 --> 24:07.220
Wow.

24:07.220 --> 24:08.340
The very definition

24:08.340 --> 24:09.360
of what constituted

24:09.360 --> 24:10.520
a good scientific theory

24:10.520 --> 24:11.940
was violently restructured.

24:12.360 --> 24:13.300
That sounds incredibly

24:13.300 --> 24:14.280
