24:14.660 --> 24:15.200
And the framework

24:15.200 --> 24:16.440
is very clear

24:16.440 --> 24:17.520
about the consequences

24:17.520 --> 24:19.240
of failing to perform

24:19.240 --> 24:19.840
these repairs.

24:20.320 --> 24:21.340
It models failure

24:21.340 --> 24:22.420
through the concept

24:22.420 --> 24:23.760
of distinction cascades.

24:24.460 --> 24:25.580
Distinctions do not exist

24:25.580 --> 24:26.660
