24:26.820 --> 24:27.560
They exist within

24:27.560 --> 24:28.280
a topology,

24:28.720 --> 24:29.360
a vast,

24:29.540 --> 24:30.560
interdependent web.

24:30.660 --> 24:31.220
Like a net.

24:31.560 --> 24:32.040
Exactly.

24:32.680 --> 24:33.340
If an observer

24:33.340 --> 24:34.840
allows a core,

24:35.180 --> 24:36.260
foundational distinction

24:36.260 --> 24:37.120
to collapse,

24:37.800 --> 24:38.560
