24:45.040 --> 24:45.260
Right.

24:45.380 --> 24:46.380
The collapse triggers

24:46.380 --> 24:47.120
a cascade

24:47.120 --> 24:48.540
that destabilizes

24:48.540 --> 24:49.440
all the neighboring

24:49.440 --> 24:50.580
concepts that relied

24:50.580 --> 24:51.340
on that boundary.

24:51.340 --> 24:52.820
We see this clearly

24:52.820 --> 24:53.720
in linguistics

24:53.720 --> 24:54.540
and sociology.

24:54.860 --> 24:55.340
Think about

24:55.340 --> 24:56.160
semantic shift.

24:56.300 --> 24:57.280
That's a really good parallel.

24:57.720 --> 24:58.340
If a society

24:58.340 --> 24:59.500
loses the cultural

24:59.500 --> 25:00.300
and institutional

25:00.300 --> 25:01.380
energy required

25:01.380 --> 25:01.940
to maintain

25:01.940 --> 25:02.920
the strict distinction

25:02.920 --> 25:04.200
between objective truth

25:04.200 --> 25:05.380
and subjective opinion,

25:05.680 --> 25:06.860
it isn't just one

25:06.860 --> 25:07.960
