25:07.960 --> 25:08.560
that degrades.

25:08.800 --> 25:09.700
No, the damage spreads.

25:09.860 --> 25:10.240
Suddenly,

25:10.520 --> 25:11.660
adjacent load-bearing

25:11.660 --> 25:13.000
concepts like journalism,

25:13.380 --> 25:13.920
