Or consider

25:20.400 --> 25:21.520
government policy.

25:22.300 --> 25:23.560
If a welfare institution

25:23.560 --> 25:24.920
loses the operational

25:24.920 --> 25:26.040
ability to distinguish

25:26.040 --> 25:27.020
between a citizen

25:27.020 --> 25:27.920
