25:35.300 --> 25:36.300
and eventually causing

25:36.300 --> 25:37.800
the entire welfare apparatus

25:37.800 --> 25:38.380
to fail.

25:38.660 --> 25:40.100
That is the exact anatomy

25:40.100 --> 25:41.420
of a distinction cascade.

25:42.020 --> 25:43.000
It is the rapid,

25:43.240 --> 25:44.160
exponential unraveling

25:44.680 --> 25:46.220
of an observer's ability

25:46.220 --> 25:47.580
