25:47.580 --> 25:48.800
It's terrifying.

25:48.800 --> 25:49.260
It is.

25:49.500 --> 25:50.200
Which provides

25:50.200 --> 25:51.700
the perfect logical bridge

25:51.700 --> 25:53.220
to the next major domain

25:53.220 --> 25:53.860
of the briefing,

25:54.560 --> 25:55.500
artificial intelligence.

25:55.580 --> 25:56.300
Yes, let's get into

25:56.300 --> 25:57.100
the AI stuff.

25:57.200 --> 25:58.420
Because if a human society

25:58.420 --> 25:59.820
